 "description": "<p>Not entirely accurate preview anymore since you can set your own settings. Press F12 to configure the mod.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IctaBLR.gif\" alt=\"A8q0NLy.png\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download BrightLasers</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-brightlasers</code></li>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-brightlasers</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
